# General Rules

- Read `docs/PRD.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DESIGN.md`, and `docs/RULES.md` before large changes.
- Use TypeScript.
- Reuse existing components and services.
- Do not duplicate business logic.
- Do not modify unrelated files.
- Keep implementation aligned with `TASKS.md`.
- Record permanent architecture changes in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
- Update `docs/MEMORY.md` after meaningful milestones.
